      Return ONLY valid JSON:
      {
        "genre": ["MainGenre", "SecondaryGenre"], 
        "subgenre": ["Sub1", "Sub2"], 
        "worldMusic": ["Tag1", "Tag2"], 
        "moods": ["Tag1", "Tag2"], 
        "themes": ["Tag1", "Tag2"], 
